<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR3b0003-cs-efd3821f" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Translation of 孫子 into (Czech)</title><editor role="translator">David Sehnal</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="1"><ab>This work is in the public domain</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title/>2026</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#KR3b0003"><title xml:lang="och">孫子</title></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="cs">Czech</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#dsehnal">Initially created: <date>2026-05-09T23:39:04.154+09:00</date> by dsehnal</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="KR3b0003-start"><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-09T23:39:57.688+09:00">Sunzi řekl:</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-09T23:41:02.065+09:00">"Vojenství </seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T00:21:42.728+09:00">je zásadní věcí pro stát.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-09T23:44:31.037+09:00">Je to rozhodující půda pro přežití,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-09T23:45:21.011+09:00">způsob, jak si zachovat existenci nebo zahynout.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T00:01:52.666+09:00">Je nezbytné ho podrobně studovat.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T00:21:58.91+09:00">Proto se za jeho osnovu považuje pět věcí, </seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-09T23:53:04.136+09:00">poměřuje se pomocí kalkulací,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-09T23:52:51.368+09:00">a tak se zjišťuje pravý stav věcí.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-09T23:57:28.964+09:00">První [věcí] je "doktrína",</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-09T23:55:37.787+09:00">druhou je "příroda",</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-09T23:55:54.716+09:00">třetí je "terén",</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-09T23:56:15.415+09:00">čtvrtou je "velitel"</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-09T23:56:45.964+09:00">pátou je "řád".</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-09T23:59:39.127+09:00">Doktrína</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T00:59:19.961+09:00">zajistí, aby měli lid i vládce totožné úmysly,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T00:59:35.282+09:00">proto je [lid] ochoten spolu s ním zemřít,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:00:22.297+09:00">je schopen s ním přežít,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:00:44.024+09:00">nebojí se nebezpečí.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:02:35.182+09:00">Příroda,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:02:23.743+09:00">to je světlo a stín, chlad a horko, režim ročních období.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:02:41.319+09:00">Terén,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:04:46.352+09:00">to je výška, vzdálenost, průchodnost, šířka, podmínky přežití.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:05:00.573+09:00">Velitel,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:05:36.997+09:00">to je inteligence, důvěryhodnost, lidskost, chrabrost, přísnost.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:05:49.402+09:00">Vojenské řády,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:08:46.933+09:00">to je struktura jednotek, důstojnická hierarchie a logistika.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:15:52.641+09:00">Pokud jde o těchto pět [osnov],</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:16:41.547+09:00">slyšel o nich každý velitel.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:17:06.018+09:00">Ten, kdo jim opravdu rozumí, zvítězí,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:17:32.469+09:00">ten, kdo jim nerozumí, nezvítězí.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:17:58.516+09:00">Proto se poměřují kalkulacemi</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:18:32.034+09:00">a zjišťuje se pravý stav věcí,</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:18:39.269+09:00">a to je:</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:19:15.221+09:00">Kdo z vládců má správnou doktrínu?</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:19:45.922+09:00">Kdo má schopnější velitele?</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:20:14.32+09:00">Kdo má výhodu v přírodě a terénu?</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.33" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:26:18.151+09:00">Čí zákony a rozkazy jsou plněny?</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.34" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:27:07.155+09:00">Kdo má silnější a početnější vojsko?</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.35" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:27:40.065+09:00">Kdo má vycvičenější vojáky a důstojníky?</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.36" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:28:07.236+09:00">Kdo má transparentnější systém odměn a trestů?</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-2a.37" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T01:29:02.172+09:00">Podle tohoto poznáme, kdo zvítězí a kdo bude poražen.</seg><seg corresp="#KR3b0003_tls_001-3a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#dsehnal" modified="2026-05-10T02:51:28.888+09:00"> </seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>